============================================================
21. IMPORTANT DISTINCTION:
TRAINING VS LIVE INFERENCE
============================================================

Our current video pipeline can create:

30-frame feature sequences.


However, these sequences alone are NOT enough to train an
LSTM.


Why?

Because the model needs labels.


For example:

Sequence 1 → Normal
Sequence 2 → Normal
Sequence 3 → Accident
Sequence 4 → Normal
Sequence 5 → Anomaly


The training process learns the relationship between:

Temporal feature sequence
        +
Ground-truth label
        ↓
LSTM


After training, the model can receive a new sequence:

New 30-frame sequence
        ↓
Trained LSTM
        ↓
Anomaly probability / class


Therefore:

Feature extraction
≠
Model training


We have currently completed the feature-extraction foundation.


