22. LABELLED DATA
============================================================

For supervised temporal anomaly detection, we need data where
the relevant events are labelled.

Possible categories include:

Normal
Accident
Abnormal movement
Collision
Other anomalies


The project specification identifies candidate datasets such
as:

- UCF-Crime
- XD-Violence
- DoTA


The exact dataset and label structure need to be evaluated
before training the LSTM.


Important principle:

The dataset must match the actual task.

A dataset containing generic anomalies may not automatically
provide the exact labels needed for vehicle accident detection.


